.TH WORDCRAFT-CLI 1 "2026" "WordCraft" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wordcraft-cli \- WordCraft from the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wordcraft-cli convert
\fIin out\fR [\fB\-\-markup\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli info
\fIfile\fR
.br
.B wordcraft-cli text
\fIfile\fR
.br
.B wordcraft-cli inspect
\fIfile\fR
.br
.B wordcraft-cli render
\fIfile out.png\fR [\fB\-\-page\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-scale\fR \fIS\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli run
[\fB\-\-file\fR \fIF\fR | \fB\-\-template\fR \fIT\fR] \fB\-\-cmd\fR \fI'id={json}'\fR [\fB\-\-cmd\fR ...] [\fB\-\-save\fR \fIOUT\fR] [\fB\-\-print\fR] [\fB\-\-author\fR \fINAME\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli commands
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli parity
[\fB\-\-markdown\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli mcp
[\fB\-\-connect\fR \fIHOST:PORT\fR | \fB\-\-author\fR \fINAME\fR]
.br
.B wordcraft-cli \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Headless WordCraft: convert between formats (docx, doc [read], pdf, odt,
rtf, html, md, tex, txt, json, png), inspect documents, render pages,
run commands, and serve the MCP server.
\fB\-\-page\fR needs a positive integer, \fB\-\-scale\fR a positive number;
bad values are errors, never silent defaults.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wordcraft (1)
